Gitorian includes Arc UI Free accordion, badge, button, calendar, checkbox, date-picker,
dialog, input, popover, select, tabs, textarea, tree-view, foundation, and motion token sources.
Source: https://uiarc.dev and https://github.com/kuratlielia/arc-library
Their MIT notice is retained at src/renderer/components/arc/LICENSE.
Arc source was formatted for this repository. Its theme and component styling
are retained, with component-scoped keyboard focus feedback, inert collapsed
accordion panels, vertical tabs, and a portaled date-picker popup that fits the
desktop window.

Runtime dependency licenses are supplied with the packaged dependencies and
Electron's LICENSES.chromium.html. No Arc Pro source is included.

The GitHub circular mark is from GitHub's MIT-licensed Primer Octicons:
https://github.com/primer/octicons/blob/main/icons/mark-github-24.svg
Its full MIT notice is embedded in src/renderer/assets/github-mark.svg.
